997
01:06:31,335 --> 01:06:34,468
Dad, I've called you
three times,

998
01:06:34,512 --> 01:06:36,818
please call me back!

999
01:06:36,862 --> 01:06:40,387
People are asking questions
and I'm sick of
making excuses.

1000
01:06:40,431 --> 01:06:42,824
You got something
to tell me? Fuck!

1001
01:07:49,456 --> 01:07:51,371
You wanna play games,
motherfucker?

1002
01:07:52,590 --> 01:07:54,592
All right, I'll play.

1003
01:09:35,432 --> 01:09:36,476
You okay?

1004
01:09:39,740 --> 01:09:40,915
Hey!

1005
01:09:48,009 --> 01:09:49,402
Help!

1006
01:11:25,846 --> 01:11:26,847
Pete?

1007
01:11:28,501 --> 01:11:30,198
Pete, wake up.

1008
01:11:30,242 --> 01:11:31,243
Pete!

1009
01:11:35,421 --> 01:11:37,249
What? Zeke?

1010
01:11:37,293 --> 01:11:38,381
Fuck.

1011
01:11:39,512 --> 01:11:41,079
Get me the fuck down, Zeke.

1012
01:11:41,558 --> 01:11:42,646
Come on!

1013
01:11:42,689 --> 01:11:44,125
You hacked the computer.

1014
01:11:45,518 --> 01:11:47,825
You erased
the surveillance footage.

1015
01:11:47,868 --> 01:11:49,435
I don't know what the fuck
you're talking about, Zeke.

1016
01:11:49,479 --> 01:11:51,307
-Did you kill Angie?
-What?

1017
01:11:51,350 --> 01:11:52,656
Did you kill Boz?

1018
01:11:52,699 --> 01:11:53,700
What the fuck
are you talking about?

1019
01:11:53,744 --> 01:11:55,136
Did you kill Boz?

1020
01:11:55,180 --> 01:11:57,051
Boz? Fuck...

1021
01:11:57,095 --> 01:11:58,139
What the fuck
is with you, Zeke?

1022
01:11:58,183 --> 01:11:59,576
Get me the fuck out of here!

1023
01:11:59,619 --> 01:12:02,230
Is this some sick
fucking revenge, Zeke?

1024
01:12:02,274 --> 01:12:04,320
Putting me in jail
isn't enough, huh?

1025
01:12:04,363 --> 01:12:05,756
Get me the fuck out of here!

1026
01:12:15,374 --> 01:12:17,245
<i>Hello, Detective Banks.</i>

1027
01:12:17,289 --> 01:12:19,247
<i>I want to play a game.</i>

1028
01:12:19,291 --> 01:12:22,250
<i>When Peter Dunleavy</i>
<i>murdered an innocent man,</i>

1029
01:12:22,294 --> 01:12:24,949
<i>your career</i>
<i>was shattered like glass.</i>

1030
01:12:24,992 --> 01:12:26,994
<i>Can you stand on the sidelines</i>

1031
01:12:27,038 --> 01:12:29,693
<i>while justice</i>
<i>is finally served?</i>

1032
01:12:29,736 --> 01:12:31,521
<i>There is a way to save him,</i>

1033
01:12:31,564 --> 01:12:35,525
<i>or you can keep him locked up</i>
<i>and throw away the key.</i>

1034
01:12:35,568 --> 01:12:37,918
<i>The decision is yours.</i>

1035
01:12:37,962 --> 01:12:39,790
"Throw away the key,"
what the fuck?

1036
01:12:39,833 --> 01:12:42,401
Huh?

1037
01:12:53,543 --> 01:12:55,414
Get me the fuck
out of this thing.

1038
01:12:57,242 --> 01:12:58,243
Zeke!

1039
01:12:59,462 --> 01:13:02,073
Oh, shit.

1040
01:13:07,078 --> 01:13:08,166
Come on, Zeke.

1041
01:13:09,907 --> 01:13:11,125
Get me the fuck
out of here, Zeke!

1042
01:13:18,394 --> 01:13:19,482
Shit!

1043
01:13:25,662 --> 01:13:27,185
Zeke! Help me!

1044
01:13:32,843 --> 01:13:33,887
Zeke?

1045
01:13:35,759 --> 01:13:37,325
Get me down, come on, man.

1046
01:13:57,345 --> 01:13:58,390
Zeke!

1047
01:14:03,351 --> 01:14:05,528
Zeke!

1048
01:14:05,571 --> 01:14:07,791
<i>...or</i>
<i>you can keep him locked up</i>

1049
01:14:07,834 --> 01:14:09,532
<i>and throw away the key.</i>

1050
01:14:10,533 --> 01:14:11,534
Pete!

1051
01:14:28,855 --> 01:14:29,900
I'm coming, Pete!

1052
01:14:45,219 --> 01:14:46,220
Shit.

1053
01:14:47,439 --> 01:14:49,572
Fuck. I got you, I got you.

1054
01:14:53,663 --> 01:14:54,664
Come on, Pete.

1055
01:15:00,321 --> 01:15:01,409
Pete!

1056
01:15:02,106 --> 01:15:03,194
Pete!

1057
01:16:10,566 --> 01:16:13,264
You disloyal
piece of shit.

1058
01:16:17,529 --> 01:16:21,011
I've been loyal to you
since the first day we met.

1059
01:16:22,099 --> 01:16:24,318
Fifteen years ago.

1060
01:16:24,362 --> 01:16:26,669
The day your partner
killed my father.

1061
01:16:29,628 --> 01:16:31,804
So, Charlie,

1062
01:16:31,848 --> 01:16:34,415
you saw this cop throw
the victim off a rooftop,

1063
01:16:34,459 --> 01:16:36,679
and you can positively ID
this cop?

1064
01:16:36,722 --> 01:16:38,942
I'll testify, Officer Dunleavy.

1065
01:16:38,985 --> 01:16:40,073
I'll do it.

1066
01:16:49,343 --> 01:16:52,956
Pete! Pete!
What happened, what happened?

1067
01:16:52,999 --> 01:16:54,261
He pulled a gun on me.

1068
01:16:54,305 --> 01:16:55,959
The witness
pulled a gun on you?

1069
01:17:00,398 --> 01:17:01,660
Shh.

1070
01:17:01,704 --> 01:17:03,749
Pete killed Charlie Emmerson.

1071
01:17:03,793 --> 01:17:06,012
What? You thought
I'd use my real name?

1072
01:17:06,056 --> 01:17:08,014
Do you have any idea
how hard it was

1073
01:17:08,058 --> 01:17:09,668
to get placed
in this department,

1074
01:17:09,712 --> 01:17:11,844
to get assigned
to be your partner?

1075
01:17:15,282 --> 01:17:18,024
What about your family,
what about your son?

1076
01:17:18,068 --> 01:17:19,504
This is my son,
Charlie.

1077
01:17:22,289 --> 01:17:23,377
I don't have a son.

1078
01:17:25,728 --> 01:17:26,990
Charlie's sleeping...

1079
01:17:27,033 --> 01:17:28,905
...was sleeping.

1080
01:17:28,948 --> 01:17:30,733
<i>After Benny Wrights led Boz</i>
<i>down the subway tunnels...</i>

1081
01:17:34,562 --> 01:17:36,303
I tattooed my dad's name
on his arm.

1082
01:17:39,089 --> 01:17:40,656
Where is my father?

1083
01:17:40,699 --> 01:17:42,092
You'll see him soon.

1084
01:17:42,135 --> 01:17:43,876
Where the fuck is my father?

1085
01:17:43,920 --> 01:17:46,705
I didn't even ask him
to come down here. You did.

1086
01:17:46,749 --> 01:17:47,793
Let me borrow your phone,
shut up.

1087
01:17:47,837 --> 01:17:48,881
Okay.

1088
01:17:48,925 --> 01:17:50,709
Thank you.

1089
01:17:50,753 --> 01:17:52,189
And don't drain
my battery watching <i>Twilight.</i>

1090
01:18:12,688 --> 01:18:14,690
Where is he?

1091
01:18:14,733 --> 01:18:16,169
Don't you want to hear
my offer?

1092
01:18:16,213 --> 01:18:17,301
Do I have a choice?

1093
01:18:18,345 --> 01:18:20,826
I want to be partners.

1094
01:18:20,870 --> 01:18:23,916
You took a stand, Zeke,
against a dirty cop,

1095
01:18:23,960 --> 01:18:25,091
<i>and what did it get you?</i>

1096
01:18:27,528 --> 01:18:31,228
A lifetime of watching
your back, working alone.

1097
01:18:31,271 --> 01:18:33,099
Getting the call
for every homeless bum

1098
01:18:33,143 --> 01:18:34,753
who turns up dead.

1099
01:18:34,797 --> 01:18:35,885
I mean, let's be real,
some of these motherfuckers

1100
01:18:35,928 --> 01:18:37,713
are straight up evil.

1101
01:18:37,756 --> 01:18:39,671
Fitch not backing you up...

1102
01:18:39,715 --> 01:18:41,238
Fuck him.

1103
01:18:42,456 --> 01:18:43,762
He won't repeat that mistake.

1104
01:18:46,112 --> 01:18:48,419
<i>And Boz,</i>
<i>always lying under oath...</i>

1105
01:18:50,160 --> 01:18:52,162
But you, you're different.

1106
01:18:52,205 --> 01:18:54,904
You're Metro's finest.

1107
01:18:54,947 --> 01:18:56,906
That's why I want to
team up with you on this.

1108
01:18:56,949 --> 01:19:00,300
You find the dirty cops
and I'll take care
of the rest.

1109
01:19:00,344 --> 01:19:03,086
You want me to help you
kill cops?

1110
01:19:03,129 --> 01:19:04,522
No, fuck no.

1111
01:19:04,565 --> 01:19:06,567
Just the bad ones.

1112
01:19:06,611 --> 01:19:10,049
John Kramer was right,
the spiral.

1113
01:19:10,093 --> 01:19:14,314
A symbol of change,
evolution, progress.

1114
01:19:14,358 --> 01:19:16,142
But why limit that
to an individual

1115
01:19:16,186 --> 01:19:18,449
when you can apply it
to a whole system?

1116
01:19:18,492 --> 01:19:20,799
You got shot
for doing the right thing.

1117
01:19:20,843 --> 01:19:22,322
But let's face it, these cops?

1118
01:19:22,366 --> 01:19:23,671
They're not going to clean up
on their own.

1119
01:19:23,715 --> 01:19:25,978
But we take a tongue here,

1120
01:19:26,022 --> 01:19:28,589
a few bones there,
they'll come around.

1121
01:19:28,633 --> 01:19:31,767
We're going to fix
a broken department. Okay?

1122
01:19:31,810 --> 01:19:33,159
You and me.

1123
01:19:33,203 --> 01:19:34,204
Okay.

1124
01:19:35,596 --> 01:19:36,597
Okay.

1125
01:19:37,381 --> 01:19:38,904
Let's do it.

1126
01:19:38,948 --> 01:19:41,907
I want to trust you. I do.

1127
01:19:41,951 --> 01:19:44,867
I'm in. But my dad goes free.

1128
01:19:50,307 --> 01:19:52,352
One second.

1129
01:19:52,396 --> 01:19:54,746
<i>911,</i>
<i>please state your emergency.</i>

1130
01:19:54,790 --> 01:19:56,792
Hello, uh, I'm at
the old soap factory

1131
01:19:56,835 --> 01:19:58,054
on Madigan Lane.

1132
01:19:58,097 --> 01:19:59,533
There's a crazy guy
with a gun,

1133
01:19:59,577 --> 01:20:01,492
he's firing it everywhere.
Please hurry!

1134
01:20:01,535 --> 01:20:03,146
What the fuck was that?

1135
01:20:03,189 --> 01:20:05,017
You better hurry,
Zeke, SWAT's on the way.

1136
01:20:05,061 --> 01:20:07,585
Look, I want to believe you,
I do.

1137
01:20:10,066 --> 01:20:11,154
I want to trust you.

1138
01:20:12,329 --> 01:20:13,939
Take this, you'll need it.

1139
01:20:13,983 --> 01:20:14,984
Come on.

1140
01:20:16,899 --> 01:20:18,378
Let's go see your dad.

1141
01:20:26,822 --> 01:20:27,910
It's time for your final test.

1142
01:20:40,183 --> 01:20:41,532
Dad.

1143
01:20:41,575 --> 01:20:42,620
Ezekiel.

1144
01:20:42,663 --> 01:20:44,056
Oh, shit! Get him down!

1145
01:20:49,366 --> 01:20:50,671
Oh, shit.

1146
01:20:53,849 --> 01:20:54,893
I got you, Dad.

1147
01:20:54,937 --> 01:20:56,503
Zeke. Help me, son.

1148
01:20:59,985 --> 01:21:01,639
Don't worry, don't worry.

1149
01:21:01,682 --> 01:21:04,468
I'm not going to let you die.
I will get you down.

1150
01:21:08,820 --> 01:21:09,995
It's all right, just hold on.

1151
01:21:10,039 --> 01:21:11,997
Shoot this motherfucker
right now.

1152
01:21:13,694 --> 01:21:16,480
Get him down!
Get him down now!

1153
01:21:17,785 --> 01:21:19,700
I thought we were partners.

1154
01:21:19,744 --> 01:21:21,964
You going to shoot me, Zeke?

1155
01:21:22,007 --> 01:21:23,313
With your one bullet?

1156
01:21:23,356 --> 01:21:24,444
Bad idea.

1157
01:21:24,488 --> 01:21:25,793
It kills your dad.

1158
01:21:28,448 --> 01:21:30,015
He took a shot at me,
by the way.

1159
01:21:30,842 --> 01:21:31,887
Missed.

1160
01:21:31,930 --> 01:21:33,497
I wasted four.

1161
01:21:33,540 --> 01:21:35,238
That means
you got one shot left, Zeke.

1162
01:21:37,196 --> 01:21:41,157
All right, cops are here.
That gives us four minutes.

1163
01:21:41,200 --> 01:21:43,724
Do you know
there's 1.5 gallons of blood
in the human body, Zeke?

1164
01:21:48,077 --> 01:21:50,253
At the rate
your old man is bleeding out,

1165
01:21:50,296 --> 01:21:53,169
in just three minutes,
those jars will be full

1166
01:21:53,212 --> 01:21:56,041
and your dad will be dead.

1167
01:21:56,085 --> 01:21:57,608
The only thing
that can set him free

1168
01:21:57,651 --> 01:22:01,612
is the bullet in your gun
fired at that target.

1169
01:22:01,655 --> 01:22:03,875
Either way, I've got
a foolproof way out of here.

1170
01:22:05,659 --> 01:22:06,660
You're not Jigsaw.

1171
01:22:07,400 --> 01:22:08,401
That's the game.

1172
01:22:09,620 --> 01:22:12,275
Shoot me and you both lose.

1173
01:22:12,318 --> 01:22:15,017
Shoot the target
and we both win.

1174
01:22:15,060 --> 01:22:16,409
You want to play?

1175
01:22:16,453 --> 01:22:19,978
I'm dying, Zeke,
end it now.

1176
01:22:20,022 --> 01:22:21,675
<i>In this corridor.</i>

1177
01:22:21,719 --> 01:22:23,590
<i>Roger that.</i>
<i>Southwest entrance.</i>

1178
01:22:25,027 --> 01:22:26,202
<i>Going through the south door.</i>

1179
01:22:28,465 --> 01:22:30,206
<i>Nothing here. Keep moving.</i>

1180
01:22:30,249 --> 01:22:31,859
I need you all in.

1181
01:22:31,903 --> 01:22:33,383
Dunleavy ruined both our lives

1182
01:22:33,426 --> 01:22:35,167
and you tried to help
that piece of shit?

1183
01:22:35,211 --> 01:22:37,517
-Zeke!
-Pete!

1184
01:22:37,561 --> 01:22:39,389
You failed that test.

1185
01:22:39,432 --> 01:22:41,521
Now I need you to choose
who you're really with.

1186
01:22:41,565 --> 01:22:43,436
The man
who corrupted the force,

1187
01:22:43,480 --> 01:22:45,482
or the one
who's trying to save it.

1188
01:22:45,525 --> 01:22:46,613
You want to tell him, Chief?

1189
01:22:49,138 --> 01:22:51,009
Tell me what?

1190
01:22:51,053 --> 01:22:53,751
Tell him about all the fucking
shit you did under Article 8.

1191
01:22:54,795 --> 01:22:56,232
What's he talking about?

1192
01:22:56,275 --> 01:22:57,973
-Time's running out.
-What's he talking about?

1193
01:22:58,016 --> 01:23:01,106
Citizens were dying.

1194
01:23:01,150 --> 01:23:04,980
We did what we had to
to clean up the streets.

1195
01:23:05,023 --> 01:23:06,807
It was crazy
back then, right?

1196
01:23:06,851 --> 01:23:08,853
We were working
under Article 8,

1197
01:23:08,896 --> 01:23:10,072
we were out of control.

1198
01:23:12,161 --> 01:23:14,163
Murder rate went way down.

1199
01:23:14,206 --> 01:23:16,295
That's fucking bullshit.

1200
01:23:16,339 --> 01:23:18,036
People felt safe again.

1201
01:23:18,080 --> 01:23:20,647
The streets got cleaner
because the cops got dirtier.

1202
01:23:20,691 --> 01:23:22,475
Your dad oversaw
the whole thing, by the way.

1203
01:23:22,519 --> 01:23:25,391
Innocent people getting shot,
all in the name of justice.

1204
01:23:25,435 --> 01:23:26,827
Article 8 was
one of the most corrupt

1205
01:23:26,871 --> 01:23:28,699
police policies in history,

1206
01:23:28,742 --> 01:23:30,353
and guess who was
your dad's right-hand man?

1207
01:23:30,396 --> 01:23:32,224
Sorry, or should I say woman,
the whole time?

1208
01:23:32,268 --> 01:23:35,314
We'll handle it.
We always do, huh?

1209
01:23:35,358 --> 01:23:36,402
Angie?

1210
01:23:36,446 --> 01:23:37,577
Angie!

1211
01:23:37,621 --> 01:23:39,101
It was Angie.

1212
01:23:39,144 --> 01:23:40,450
I mean,
not a massive surprise.

1213
01:23:40,493 --> 01:23:42,321
You think it was
her stellar reputation

1214
01:23:42,365 --> 01:23:44,236
that got her a precinct
at age 35? Come on.

1215
01:23:44,280 --> 01:23:47,283
Shoot this piece of shit,
Ezekiel. Now.

1216
01:23:47,326 --> 01:23:49,067
Yeah, that's right,
because that's what cops do.

1217
01:23:49,111 --> 01:23:50,286
Shoot first,
ask questions later.

1218
01:23:53,767 --> 01:23:57,032
You watched my father die
and I'm trying to save yours.

1219
01:23:57,075 --> 01:23:58,859
If we're going to trust
each other,

1220
01:23:58,903 --> 01:23:59,904
I need you to do this.

1221
01:24:01,297 --> 01:24:02,820
Ezekiel...

1222
01:24:02,863 --> 01:24:06,867
You've always done
the right thing, do it now.

1223
01:24:06,911 --> 01:24:08,608
This piece of shit
is killing cops.

1224
01:24:10,306 --> 01:24:12,134
You still need to decide,

1225
01:24:12,177 --> 01:24:15,789
you can shoot me, or...

1226
01:24:15,833 --> 01:24:16,921
Or you can save your dad.

1227
01:24:18,749 --> 01:24:20,359
Clock's ticking, man.

1228
01:24:20,403 --> 01:24:21,578
Think fast.

1229
01:24:22,448 --> 01:24:24,102
Cavalry's coming.

1230
01:24:24,146 --> 01:24:26,278
But not in time to do
any favors for your old man.

1231
01:24:26,322 --> 01:24:27,540
Only you can do that.

1232
01:24:35,896 --> 01:24:37,072
Dad? Dad?

1233
01:24:38,334 --> 01:24:39,335
Shots fired!

1234
01:24:49,171 --> 01:24:50,476
Zeke... Zeke.

1235
01:24:51,695 --> 01:24:52,739
It's going to be okay.

1236
01:24:52,783 --> 01:24:56,003
He's getting away.

1237
01:24:56,047 --> 01:24:58,093
Don't let him get away.

1238
01:24:58,658 --> 01:25:00,791
Go... Go!

1239
01:25:18,548 --> 01:25:20,941
Stop. Don't come in.

1240
01:25:20,985 --> 01:25:22,029
Don't come in.

1241
01:25:36,957 --> 01:25:37,958
Oh, God.

1242
01:25:39,786 --> 01:25:42,789
Whoever did this has another
motive, something personal.

1243
01:25:42,833 --> 01:25:44,095
Whoever did this...

1244
01:25:46,837 --> 01:25:47,925
...they're pulling
all the strings.

1245
01:25:51,624 --> 01:25:53,757
Your dad is the reason
for all of this.

1246
01:25:53,800 --> 01:25:55,541
He's why I wanted to do this
in the first place.

1247
01:25:55,585 --> 01:25:57,456
I've been dreaming about this
since I was 12 years old.

1248
01:26:04,376 --> 01:26:06,291
What the fuck is going on?

1249
01:26:10,252 --> 01:26:12,993
Go, go, go!

1250
01:26:13,037 --> 01:26:14,517
Get down! Get down now!

1251
